{"3889480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Thekku Island", "steam_appid": 3889480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4504470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thekku Island</strong> is a story-driven, first-person horror game set on a <strong>fictional island in 1980s Kerala, India</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive on a remote island after weeks of silence from your wife — she vanished without a trace. As you search the abandoned house and the dark forests around it, you're pulled deeper into a chilling mystery that refuses to stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/f759caf3423eedd743fba662edcb226e.poster.avif?t=1784487123\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/f759caf3423eedd743fba662edcb226e.webm?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/f759caf3423eedd743fba662edcb226e.mp4?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, eerie whispers and unsettling noises echo through the halls. Shadows seem to move on their own, creeping across the walls as if alive. The deeper you go, the more you realize — something is terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/e8668d276eb17a49d9e7126a8838bbd0.poster.avif?t=1784487123\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/e8668d276eb17a49d9e7126a8838bbd0.webm?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/e8668d276eb17a49d9e7126a8838bbd0.mp4?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Indian ghost stories, <i>Thekku Island</i> blends <strong>psychological horror</strong>, <strong>classic ghost encounters</strong>, and <strong>jumpscare tension</strong> into an atmospheric experience where <strong>every clue deepens the mystery</strong>. There are no easy answers — only whispers from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/11ea905e118b61c7c0fb4972d2e58461.poster.avif?t=1784487123\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/11ea905e118b61c7c0fb4972d2e58461.webm?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/11ea905e118b61c7c0fb4972d2e58461.mp4?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thekku Island</strong> is a story-driven, first-person horror game set on a <strong>fictional island in 1980s Kerala, India</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive on a remote island after weeks of silence from your wife — she vanished without a trace. As you search the abandoned house and the dark forests around it, you're pulled deeper into a chilling mystery that refuses to stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin