kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/11ea905e118b61c7c0fb4972d2e58461.poster.avif?t=1784487123\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/11ea905e118b61c7c0fb4972d2e58461.webm?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/11ea905e118b61c7c0fb4972d2e58461.mp4?t=1784487123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A chilling psychological horror set in 1980s Kerala. After weeks of silence, you arrive on a remote island to search for your missing wife. Explore an abandoned house, uncover local folklore, survive haunting encounters, and unravel the island’s buried secrets.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/bb15fb9c282c2ed4316c3abd69b5dd374df05267/header.jpg?t=1784487123", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/e10cef6ebb8500088685f498d0ffb441dfd052e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784487123", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/e10cef6ebb8500088685f498d0ffb441dfd052e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784487123", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 / AMD RX 570 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and 